<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54939" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fall</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὀχήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.560
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					261.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>collapse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ συγκοπή ἐστι κ. δυνάμεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.837
				</span></i>
			; of epileptic <i>seizures</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.64
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				38.13
			</span></i> (pl.): hence of a spell which induces a <i>trance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Par.
				1.850
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>downfall, calamity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ma.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>.</div>
